<title>UK: German inland gas oil falls, buyers stand aside.</title>
<headline>German inland gas oil falls, buyers stand aside.</headline>
<text>
<p>(DLR/DM=1.6858)   DM/100 LTRS     DLRS/100 LTRS   LAST DM</p>
<p> HAMBURG	     32.80/33.20     19.46/19.69   33.10/33.50</p>
<p> BREMEN		32.80/33.20     19.46/19.69   33.10/33.50</p>
<p> DUISBURG	    33.00/33.40     19.58/19.81   33.20/33.60</p>
<p> FRANKFURT	   33.50/34.00     19.87/20.17   33.80/34.20</p>
<p> KARLSRUHE	   33.40/33.80     19.81/20.05   33.70/34.20</p>
<p> INGOLSTADT	  34.20/34.60     20.29/20.52   34.50/35.10</p>
<p>German inland gas oil fell again on Friday as a $2.00 loss on IPE futures was felt in the Rotterdam physical. Traders said only buyers with no other option to secure material were buying, all others were awaiting easier prices. -- +44 171 542 8980</p>
</text>
